  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-69-2-2013000011</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free movement of goods-study visit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Vo&#x13e;n&#xfd; pohyb tovaru-&#x161;tudijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;For the first time since the program CETIR was launched we successfully implemented a study visit for a mixed group. After addressed and subsequent&#xa0;agreement by both parties Serbian language was approved as the language for interpretation of presentations for all members of both delegations.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;In mixed groups it is very important that both sides agreed to the agenda, its topics and the proposed language of the presentations.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;V&#xf4;bec po prv&#xfd; kr&#xe1;t od spustenia realiz&#xe1;cie programu CETIR sme &#xfa;spe&#x161;ne zrealizovali &#x161;tudijn&#xfa; n&#xe1;v&#x161;tevu pre zmie&#x161;an&#xfa; skupinu. Po osloven&#xed; a n&#xe1;slednom s&#xfa;hlase oboch str&#xe1;n bola srb&#x10d;ina schv&#xe1;len&#xe1; ako jazyk, do ktor&#xe9;ho bud&#xfa; pre kr&#xe1;tkos&#x165; &#x10d;asu v&#x161;etky predn&#xe1;&#x161;ky a konzult&#xe1;cie tlmo&#x10d;en&#xe9;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;V pr&#xed;pade zmie&#x161;an&#xfd;ch skup&#xed;n je ve&#x13e;mi d&#xf4;le&#x17e;it&#xe9;, aby obe strany vopred s&#xfa;hlasili s n&#xe1;pl&#x148;ou, t&#xe9;mami a nesk&#xf4;r aj s navrhovan&#xfd;m jazykom tlmo&#x10d;enia prezent&#xe1;ci&#xed;, aby sa predi&#x161;lo vyru&#x161;ovaniu medzi jednotliv&#xfd;mi &#x10d;lenmi deleg&#xe1;ci&#xed;, a aby nevznikli pochybnosti, &#x10d;i je niekto zv&#xfd;hod&#x148;ovan&#xfd; alebo nie.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
